{%- comment -%}
  Customer-facing name for a garment.

  custom.style and productType stay as the internal keys ("Oversized Light-Soft"),
  because every automated collection matches on productType and every script and
  swatch rule keys on style. But "Oversized Light-Soft" does not tell a shopper what
  the garment is, so anywhere a name is SHOWN it goes through here instead.

  Accepts: style (string). Falls back to the style itself, so a garment added later
  still renders something sensible.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  case style
    when 'Oversized Light-Soft'
      assign out = 'Oversized Light-Soft T-Shirt'
    when 'Oversized Heavy Premium'
      assign out = 'Oversized Heavy Premium T-Shirt'
    else
      assign out = style
  endcase
-%}
{{- out -}}
